orks/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c7805d5/uploads/origins/0a0e46db-64d7-473a-be58-76aecdfc9abe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1adb7fca1e133972a639dc18a8631fe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c7805d5/uploads/origins/0a0e46db-64d7-473a-be58-76aecdfc9abe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1adb7fca1e133972a639dc18a8631fe, https://si.imgix.net/4c7805d5/uploads/origins/0a0e46db-64d7-473a-be58-76aecdfc9abe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7cae068cdce0359f9d1e64782624224a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c7805d5/uploads/origins/0a0e46db-64d7-473a-be58-76aecdfc9abe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cf1a289690416396c5a5cf45ae3c457 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "もし興味があるなら、僕のザングースの絵を描いてほしいんだ。\n以前あなたが描いたこのポーズに似ていますが、顔に手を当てています。不機嫌そうな退屈そうな態度：https://twitter.com/natsutyu/status/1358645959614365697/photo/1\n\n体型は好きなように調整してください。\nありがとう！\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1190820824324771891/1190822358445985832/noclothes2.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@natsutyu/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/522048f9/uploads/origins/119aa4e9-ebf4-45f5-ab0c-5165e6df085a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29bcb87dddef4fd5eee49af3174fa1bf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/522048f9/uploads/origins/119aa4e9-ebf4-45f5-ab0c-5165e6df085a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29bcb87dddef4fd5eee49af3174fa1bf, https://si.imgix.net/522048f9/uploads/origins/119aa4e9-ebf4-45f5-ab0c-5165e6df085a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7420f2eaca6025a03702bb2cf5c51f16 2x, https://si.imgix.net/522048f9/uploads/origins/119aa4e9-ebf4-45f5-ab0c-5165e6df085a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd2b64008e